#: createlipdetectionconditionwidget.cpp:30
msgid "Lip Detection"
msgstr "Pronalaženje usana"

#: createlipdetectionconditionwidget.cpp:31
#: createlipdetectionconditionwidget.cpp:50
#: createlipdetectionconditionwidget.cpp:60
msgid "&Start Training"
msgstr "&Započni obuku"

#: createlipdetectionconditionwidget.cpp:56
msgid "Failed to initialize video capture."
msgstr "Inicijalizacija snimka videozapisa nije uspjela."

#: createlipdetectionconditionwidget.cpp:73
msgid "Speaking."
msgstr "Pričanje."

#: createlipdetectionconditionwidget.cpp:79
msgid "Not speaking."
msgstr "Bez pričanja."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, lblThreshold_2)
#: createlipdetectionconditionwidget.ui:28
msgid ""
"The lip detection condition will evaluate to true while you are speaking by "
"monitoring your lip movements.\n"
"\n"
"You can adjust the sensitivity of this detection with the slider below."
msgstr ""
"Prateći pokrete Vaših usana dok pričate, procjenjivat će se stanje "
"pronalaska usana.\n"
"\n"
"Možete podesiti osjetljivost pronalaženja pomoću dolje prikazanog klizača."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, lblSilderValue)
#: createlipdetectionconditionwidget.ui:80
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, lblThreshold)
#: createlipdetectionconditionwidget.ui:92
msgid ""
"To detect an optimal value automatically, select \"Start Training\" below, "
"speak a sentence, and stop the training again."
msgstr ""
"Kako bi optimalna vrijednost bila automatski pronađena, označite \"Započni "
"obuku\" ispod, izgovorite rečenicu, pa ponovo zaustavite obuku."

#: lipdetectioncondition.cpp:58
msgctxt ""
"Detecting Whether the user is speaking or not by detecting lip movements"
msgid "User is speaking"
msgstr "Korisnik govori"

#: lipdetectioncondition.cpp:60
msgctxt ""
"Detecting Whether the user is speaking or not by detecting lip movements"
msgid "User is not speaking"
msgstr "Korisnik ne govori"
